T273	Quotation 33102 33229	"Because he'd just got that whack when Injun Joe done it. D'you reckon he could see anything? D'you reckon he knowed anything?"
T274	Quotation 33230 33257	"By hokey, that's so, Tom!"
T275	Quotation 33258 33317	"And besides, look-a-here-- maybe that whack done for HIM!"
T276	Quotation 33318 33670	"No, 'taint likely, Tom. He had liquor in him; I could see that; and besides, he always has. Well, when pap's full, you might take and belt him over the head with a church and you couldn't phase him. He says so, his own self. So it's the same with Muff Potter, of course. But if a man was dead sober, I reckon maybe that whack might fetch him; I dono."
