T530	Quotation 70035 70282	"people don't go much on hermits, nowadays, like they used to in old times, but a pirate's always respected. And a hermit's got to sleep on the hardest place he can find, and put sackcloth and ashes on his head, and stand out in the rain, and -- "
R649	Cueing Arg1:T528 Arg2:T530	
R650	Speaker Arg1:T529 Arg2:T530	
