R658	Speaker Arg1:T529 Arg2:T534	
R659	Addressee Arg1:T531 Arg2:T534	
T535	Quotation 70452 70472	"Dern'd if I would,"
T536	Cue 70473 70477	said
T537	Entity 70478 70482	Huck
