R882	Addressee Arg1:T711 Arg2:T718	
T719	Quotation 101741 101860	"Why, many a time I've looked at people smoking, and thought well I wish I could do that; but I never thought I could,"
T720	Cue 101861 101865	said
T721	Entity 101866 101869	Tom
T722	Quotation 101871 102010	"That's just the way with me, hain't it, Huck? You've heard me talk just that way-- haven't you, Huck? I'll leave it to Huck if I haven't."
