R912	Speaker Arg1:T738 Arg2:T739	
R913	Addressee Arg1:T736 Arg2:T739	
T741	Quotation 102499 102519	"I don't feel sick."
R914	Cueing Arg1:T740 Arg2:T741	
R915	Speaker Arg1:T738 Arg2:T741	
T742	Quotation 102520 102535	"Neither do I,"
