R919	Addressee Arg1:T738 Arg2:T742	
T745	Quotation 102546 102611	"I could smoke it all day. But I bet you Jeff Thatcher couldn't."
R920	Cueing Arg1:T743 Arg2:T745	
R921	Speaker Arg1:T744 Arg2:T745	
T746	Quotation 102612 102705	"Jeff Thatcher! Why, he'd keel over just with two draws. Just let him try it once. HE'D see!"
R922	Addressee Arg1:T738 Arg2:T745	
R923	Speaker Arg1:T738 Arg2:T746	
R924	Addressee Arg1:T744 Arg2:T746	
T747	Quotation 102706 102791	"I bet he would. And Johnny Miller -- I wish could see Johnny Miller tackle it once."
R925	Speaker Arg1:T744 Arg2:T747	
T748	Quotation 102792 102806	"Oh, don't I!"
T749	Cue 102807 102811	said
T750	Entity 102812 102815	Joe
R926	Addressee Arg1:T750 Arg2:T747	
R927	Cueing Arg1:T749 Arg2:T748	
R928	Speaker Arg1:T750 Arg2:T748	
T751	Quotation 102817 102928	"Why, I bet you Johnny Miller couldn't any more do this than nothing. Just one little snifter would fetch HIM."
R929	Addressee Arg1:T744 Arg2:T748	
R930	Cueing Arg1:T749 Arg2:T751	
R931	Speaker Arg1:T750 Arg2:T751	
T752	Quotation 102929 102992	"'Deed it would, Joe. Say -- I wish the boys could see us now."
R932	Addressee Arg1:T750 Arg2:T752	
R933	Speaker Arg1:T744 Arg2:T752	
T753	Quotation 102993 103003	"So do I."
R934	Speaker Arg1:T750 Arg2:T753	
R935	Addressee Arg1:T744 Arg2:T753	
T754	Quotation 103004 103456	"Say-- boys, don't say anything about it, and some time when they're around, I'll come up to you and say, 'Joe, got a pipe? I want a smoke.' And you'll say, kind of careless like, as if it warn't anything, you'll say, 'Yes, I got my OLD pipe, and another one, but my tobacker ain't very good.' And I'll say, 'Oh, that's all right, if it's STRONG enough.' And then you'll out with the pipes, and we'll light up just as ca'm, and then just see 'em look!"
R936	Addressee Arg1:T750 Arg2:T754	
R937	Speaker Arg1:T744 Arg2:T754	
T755	Quotation 103457 103508	"By jings, that'll be gay, Tom! I wish it was NOW!"
R938	Speaker Arg1:T750 Arg2:T755	
R939	Addressee Arg1:T744 Arg2:T755	
T756	Quotation 103509 103612	"So do I! And when we tell 'em we learned when we was off pirating, won't they wish they'd been along?"
R940	Addressee Arg1:T750 Arg2:T756	
R941	Speaker Arg1:T744 Arg2:T756	
T757	Quotation 103613 103657	"Oh, I reckon not! I'll just BET they will!"
