T801	Cue 119582 119586	said
T802	Entity 119587 119591	Mary
T803	Quotation 119593 119644	"and I believe you would if you had thought of it."
R977	Cueing Arg1:T801 Arg2:T800	
R978	Speaker Arg1:T802 Arg2:T800	
R979	Cueing Arg1:T801 Arg2:T803	
