R995	Speaker Arg1:T811 Arg2:T813	
R996	Addressee Arg1:T812 Arg2:T813	
T814	Quotation 120012 120047	"Now, auntie, that ain't any harm,"
T815	Cue 120048 120055	pleaded
T816	Entity 120056 120060	Mary
