R1002	Addressee Arg1:T811 Arg2:T817	
T818	Quotation 120154 120372	"More's the pity. Sid would have thought. And Sid would have come and DONE it, too. Tom, you'll look back, some day, when it's too late, and wish you'd cared a little more for me when it would have cost you so little."
