T824	Cue 120500 120504	said
T825	Entity 120505 120508	Tom
T826	Quotation 120533 120594	"but I dreamt about you, anyway. That's something, ain't it?"
R1010	Cueing Arg1:T824 Arg2:T823	
R1011	Speaker Arg1:T825 Arg2:T823	
R1012	Cueing Arg1:T824 Arg2:T826	
