T838	Quotation 121288 121345	"I've got it now! I've got it now! It blowed the candle!"
T839	Quotation 121346 121380	"Mercy on us! Go on, Tom-- go on!"
T840	Quotation 121381 121451	"And it seems to me that you said, 'Why, I believe that that door-- '"
